# Trakmama 🤰

A pregnancy companion for expectant and new mothers. Trakmama helps users track their health, get personalised guidance, and learn about a healthy pregnancy, with an AI chatbot for quick answers to everyday questions.

🔗 **Live demo:** https://trakmama-project-pied.vercel.app/



## Why I built it
Many expectant mothers lack easy access to reliable pregnancy information and support. I built Trakmama to put health tracking, guidance, and education in one simple, mobile-friendly place.

## Features
- 📊 Track maternal and child health indicators
- 🤖 AI chatbot for pregnancy-related questions
- 📅 Appointment scheduling
- 🔔 Daily reminders, healthy tips, and motivation
- 📚 Education on conditions such as preeclampsia, gestational diabetes, hypertension, and postpartum health
- 📱 Responsive design for mobile, tablet, and desktop

## Built with
React · TypeScript · Tailwind CSS · Node.js · Vercel

